      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Following up on that, when you talk about \"changes in social norms,\" what specifically are researchers usually seeing in these cases? Like, does the shift in certain cultural practices or religious visibility tend to be perceived by the long-term residents as a disruption to the existing social fabric or stability of the neighborhood?",
